---
title: "Medical Assistant Science I"
code: "MDA-101"
category: "medical-assisting"
credits: "5"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Provides an in-depth study of medical terminology, anatomy and physiology, and pathology for the medical assistant. Focuses on clinical application and decision-making in the health environment. Lecture 4 hours. Laboratory 2 hours. Total 6 hours per week.
